WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Hi, I'm Hannah. We're here at Leighton Stone Blueprint.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:08.640
So one of the things that I love most about coming here is that it's a small group,

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.720
and so you always feel like you've got someone's attention that are focusing on that technique

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.240
and you're going to injure yourself, but it's also really great. It's a real community.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:21.760
I really love that sense that actually I can be kind of supported to be as I can be.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:27.440
The instructors all really kind of hone in on you. They really understand what your limits are

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.600
and how far they can push you, and they do really push you and they really challenge you,

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.160
and then they'll come over and say, hang on a sec, what do you put it on there,

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.040
and hand you a different way that you think just that I forgot it in me today, but you always do,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.640
and so they always manage to kind of understand exactly what you are capable of

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.720
before you understand it, which is brilliant.

